DTSTAMP:20261106T163445Z
DTSTART:20261203T073000Z
DTEND:20261203T073500Z
SUMMARY:Door 3: Think before you paste
DESCRIPTION:DO: Use your organisation’s approved AI tools for work\, with
  data-protection settings switched on.\nDON’T: Paste customer data\, pas
 swords\, source code or contracts into public chatbots.\n\nLesson learnt (
 Samsung\, Apr 2023): Engineers pasted confidential source code and meeting
  notes into a public chatbot. Weeks later\, Samsung restricted generative 
 AI tools on company devices.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.git
 hub.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=3
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=3
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Door 3 is open
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
