DTSTAMP:20261106T163445Z
DTSTART:20261213T073000Z
DTEND:20261213T073500Z
SUMMARY:Door 13: Gift cards are for gifts
DESCRIPTION:DO: Pause and tell someone when a “tax office”\, “tech su
 pport” or “boss” demands urgent payment.\nDON’T: Pay anyone in gif
 t cards or crypto on request — the demand itself is the scam.\n\nLesson 
 learnt (FBI Internet Crime Report\, Apr 2025): Americans reported losing U
 S$9.3 billion to cryptocurrency-related fraud in 2024\, up 66% on the year
  before.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent
 2026/?day=13
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=13
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Door 13 is open
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
