DTSTAMP:20261106T163445Z
DTSTART:20261220T073000Z
DTEND:20261220T073500Z
SUMMARY:Door 20: A safe word for the family
DESCRIPTION:DO: Agree a family safe word for emergency calls and messages.\
 nDON’T: Send money on an urgent call from a “relative” or VIP — ha
 ng up and call back on a known number.\n\nLesson learnt (A cloned minister
 \, Feb 2025): Scammers cloned the voice of Defence Minister Guido Crosetto
  to ask business leaders for money. At least one paid about €1 million b
 efore police froze the funds.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.gi
 thub.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=20
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=20
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Door 20 is open
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
