UID:door-26-full-2026@cyber-advent-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261106T163445Z
DTSTART:20261226T073000Z
DTEND:20261226T073500Z
SUMMARY:Door 26: New gadget\, clean slate
DESCRIPTION:DO: Update new devices first\, set a strong screen lock\, and r
 eview AI-feature and microphone settings.\nDON’T: Sell or hand down old 
 phones and laptops before backing up and factory-resetting.\n\nLesson lear
 nt (Microsoft Recall\, Jun 2024): After researchers showed the AI screensh
 ot feature stored data in an easily readable database\, Microsoft delayed 
 it and relaunched it as opt-in with encryption.\n\nOpen the door: https://
 aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=26
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=26
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Door 26 is open
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
