SUMMARY:Door 27: Famous face\, fake offer
DESCRIPTION:DO: Treat celebrity investment ads and “guaranteed returns”
  as scams\, and check your financial regulator’s warning list.\nDON’T:
  Trust a video because the face is famous — deepfaked endorsements are a
  scam staple.\n\nLesson learnt (Martin Lewis deepfake\, Jul 2023): A deepf
 ake video of the UK consumer champion promoting an “investment” app sp
 read on social media. He warned the public it was a scam.\n\nOpen the door
 : https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=27
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=27
