SUMMARY:Door 28: Map your AI\, keep a human
DESCRIPTION:DO: Inventory your AI tools and the personal data they touch\, 
 train staff (EU AI Act Art. 4)\, and run DPIAs where GDPR requires.\nDON
 ’T: Let AI decide about customers or candidates with no human review —
  you own what your bot says.\n\nLesson learnt (Air Canada\, Feb 2024): A C
 anadian tribunal held the airline liable after its website chatbot gave a 
 customer wrong refund advice\, rejecting the idea that the bot was a separ
 ate entity.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdv
 ent2026/?day=28
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=28
