SUMMARY:Door 29: Leavers leave. Access too.
DESCRIPTION:DO: Revoke accounts\, tokens\, keys and AI-tool seats on the pe
 rson’s last day.\nDON’T: Leave shared passwords unchanged or old accou
 nts dormant “just in case”.\n\nLesson learnt (Tesla\, 2023): Two forme
 r employees leaked personal data on about 75\,000 staff to a newspaper\, T
 esla said in its breach notice.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.
 github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=29
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=29
