SUMMARY:Door 30: Speak up\, fast
DESCRIPTION:DO: Report a wrong click\, a lost device or a regretted paste i
 nto a chatbot straight away — minutes matter.\nDON’T: Hide a mistake o
 ut of embarrassment. Under NIS2\, significant incidents need an early warn
 ing within 24 hours.\n\nLesson learnt (Co-op\, Apr 2025): Co-op spotted in
 truders and shut systems down early. Members’ data was still stolen\, bu
 t by the attackers’ own account the fast shutdown stopped ransomware bei
 ng deployed.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAd
 vent2026/?day=30
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=30
