SUMMARY:Door 31: Three resolutions
DESCRIPTION:DO: Carry three habits into 2027: passkeys on\, verify before y
 ou pay\, think before you paste.\nDON’T: Treat security as a season — 
 book a January check-in and keep the habit going.\n\nLesson learnt (This c
 alendar\, 2023–2025): Change Healthcare\, 23andMe\, Arup\, M&S: in each\
 , the way in was a missing basic — MFA\, a unique password\, a call-back
 \, a verification step.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.github.i
 o/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=31
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=31
